	// 1. Write Domain:
	//    - Counter wr_cnt
	//    - Gray Code Generator for wr_gray_addr
	//    - Sample rd_gray_addr (from read domain) -> wr_rd_ptr
	//    - Full Flag: (wr_cnt == (FIFO_DEPTH-1)) && (wr_gray_addr == wr_rd_ptr)
	//    - Empty Flag: (wr_cnt == 0) && (wr_gray_addr == wr_rd_ptr)
	// 2. Read Domain:
	//    - Counter rd_cnt
	//    - Gray Code Generator for rd_gray_addr
	//    - Sample wr_gray_addr (from write domain) -> rd_wr_ptr
	//    - Full Flag: (rd_cnt == 0) && (rd_gray_addr == rd_wr_ptr)
	//    - Empty Flag: (rd_cnt == (FIFO_DEPTH-1)) && (rd_gray_addr == rd_wr_ptr)

	// Let's implement this.

	// Write Domain: Sample Read Pointer
